ific 2027 undergraduate example, an original choice matrix and a document-to-recipient ledger.\",\"image\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/images/day15/research-library-1280.webp\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-11-19\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-11-23\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass Editorial Team\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/editorial-policy/\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/logo.svg\"}},\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/scholarships/global-korea-scholarship/\"}"}}],["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is the Pakistan deadline the worldwide GKS deadline?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. It belongs to the named 2027 undergraduate country route. Other tracks, countries and degree categories need separate instructions.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I apply to any Korean university?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Use the official university-information file for your exact category and track. Ordinary admission availability does not by itself establish GKS participation.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does a later interview notice reopen applications?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No reopening is established by an event for existing candidates. Check for an explicit new application notice or amendment.\"}}]}"}}]],"$L1a",false,"$L1b","$L1c"]}]
