1d:["$","p","Keep undergraduate and graduate plans apart. An announced undergraduate cycle does not establish a master’s or doctoral opening, and a later university event may concern candidates already selected at an earlier stage. If you cannot identify the exact category, stop the deadline comparison and resolve that first. Preparation can continue without labelling the route open.",{"children":"Keep undergraduate and graduate plans apart. An announced undergraduate cycle does not establish a master’s or doctoral opening, and a later university event may concern candidates already selected at an earlier stage. If you cannot identify the exact category, stop the deadline comparison and resolve that first. Preparation can continue without labelling the route open."}]
