24:["$","p","For a current applicable embassy route, the competent country notice tells you how its first-stage application is received and assessed. A university route starts from the named participating institution and programme instructions. Use the official files for that call to identify eligible departments and submission arrangements rather than treating any Korean degree as a GKS course.",{"children":"For a current applicable embassy route, the competent country notice tells you how its first-stage application is received and assessed. A university route starts from the named participating institution and programme instructions. Use the official files for that call to identify eligible departments and submission arrangements rather than treating any Korean degree as a GKS course."}]
25:["$","p","In a fictional comparison, Course A fits your background but appears only in the relevant university-track file, while Course B fits an embassy route. The first task is to confirm those listings and route conditions, not send identical files to both recipients. Check the current rules on multiple or parallel applications before using a backup strategy. This guide does not grant permission to submit through both routes.",{"children":"In a fictional comparison, Course A fits your background but appears only in the relevant university-track file, while Course B fits an embassy route. The first task is to confirm those listings and route conditions, not send identical files to both recipients. Check the current rules on multiple or parallel applications before using a backup strategy. This guide does not grant permission to submit through both routes."}]
