27:["$","section","3-Use university choices as an academic decision",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Use university choices as an academic decision"}],[["$","p","Pakistan’s reviewed general-programme instructions permit up to three universities across TypeA and TypeB and require at least one TypeB choice; they also prohibit selecting more than one department within the same university. These are rules from that particular notice, not a universal choice allowance for every GKS category.",{"children":"Pakistan’s reviewed general-programme instructions permit up to three universities across TypeA and TypeB and require at least one TypeB choice; they also prohibit selecting more than one department within the same university. These are rules from that particular notice, not a universal choice allowance for every GKS category."}],["$","p","Prepare an original choice matrix with subject fit, language or preparatory requirements, location and the reason for each preference. If your second choice has no realistic academic match, adding it only to fill a box does not strengthen the evidence. Confirm the current programme list and whether your intended department participates. A university’s ordinary international admissions page can list courses outside the particular scholarship arrangement.",{"children":"Prepare an original choice matrix with subject fit, language or preparatory requirements, location and the reason for each preference. If your second choice has no realistic academic match, adding it only to fill a box does not strengthen the evidence. Confirm the current programme list and whether your intended department participates. A university’s ordinary international admissions page can list courses outside the particular scholarship arrangement."}]],"$undefined",[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Original academic-choice matrix","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Original academic-choice matrix"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Candidate course",{"scope":"col","children":"Candidate course"}],["$","th","Evidence of fit",{"scope":"col","children":"Evidence of fit"}],["$","th","Unresolved check",{"scope":"col","children":"Unresolved check"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"A"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Relevant prior modules or project"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Listed under the correct track?"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"B"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"A different but defensible study objective"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Department and language conditions?"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"C"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Specific academic reason"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Does the current choice rule permit it?"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://www.mofa.go.kr/pk-en/brd/m_3150/view.do?seq=762182",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.mofa.go.kr/pk-en/brd/m_3150/view.do?seq=762182","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Korean Embassy in Pakistan:2027 undergraduate country route"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}]
28:["$","section","4-Build a document-to-recipient ledger",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Build a document-to-recipient ledger"}],[["$","p","Do not start by creating one PDF labelled “all documents”. First map each required item to the recipient, format, language, certification or authenticity requirement and deadline stated for the current route. A document acceptable for an initial online assessment may still require later original verification; use the actual instructions instead of guessing that upload and final registration have identical rules.",{"children":"Do not start by creating one PDF labelled “all documents”. First map each required item to the recipient, format, language, certification or authenticity requirement and deadline stated for the current route. A document acceptable for an initial online assessment may still require later original verification; use the actual instructions instead of guessing that upload and final registration have identical rules."}],["$","p","In a fictional record, the academic transcript is available but the name differs from the passport after a documented change. Mark identity consistency as unresolved and ask the receiving authority which evidence it requires. Do not edit an official transcript yourself. Keep reference requests, issued certificates and submitted confirmations as different statuses, and avoid placing passports or application numbers in public forums while seeking advice.",{"children":"In a fictional record, the academic transcript is available but the name differs from the passport after a documented change. Mark identity consistency as unresolved and ask the receiving authority which evidence it requires. Do not edit an official transcript yourself. Keep reference requests, issued certificates and submitted confirmations as different statuses, and avoid placing passports or application numbers in public forums while seeking advice."}]],"$undefined",[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Original document-state ledger","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Original document-state ledger"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Item",{"scope":"col","children":"Item"}],["$","th","Current state",{"scope":"col","children":"Current state"}],["$","th","Next evidence",{"scope":"col","children":"Next evidence"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Academic record"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Issued"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Check name,scale and required format"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Reference"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Requested"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Correct recipient receives completed form"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Authenticity/translation"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Rule not yet resolved"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Written current instructions"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","3",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Application"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Draft complete"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Final route-specific confirmation"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
29:["$","section","5-Test a plan against a missing dependency",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Test a plan against a missing dependency"}],[["$","p","Imagine that a student has a strong statement and all course choices selected, but the required academic evidence is still awaiting issue. Their plan is not complete because the application text is polished. Identify whether the current call allows a stated alternative or later document; do not assume a promised document will be accepted after the cutoff.",{"children":"Imagine that a student has a strong statement and all course choices selected, but the required academic evidence is still awaiting issue. Their plan is not complete because the application text is polished. Identify whether the current call allows a stated alternative or later document; do not assume a promised document will be accepted after the cutoff."}],["$","p","Use a personal buffer earlier than the official deadline and label it as your own. Give every external dependency an owner and follow-up date. If an official source supplies only a date, obtain the necessary time-zone and closing-time information before treating a precise conversion as authoritative. An arithmetic conversion cannot resolve an omitted rule, and an email you sent is not proof that an institution accepted a late file.",{"children":"Use a personal buffer earlier than the official deadline and label it as your own. Give every external dependency an owner and follow-up date. If an official source supplies only a date, obtain the necessary time-zone and closing-time information before treating a precise conversion as authoritative. An arithmetic conversion cannot resolve an omitted rule, and an email you sent is not proof that an institution accepted a late file."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Test a plan against a missing dependency","children":[["$","$L5","/tools/scholarship-deadline-timezone-converter/",{"href":"/tools/scholarship-deadline-timezone-converter/","children":["Plan an explicit-zone deadline",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L5","/guides/recommendation-letter/",{"href":"/guides/recommendation-letter/","children":["Request factual references",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
2a:["$","section","6-Keep funding, selection and arrival decisions separate",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-7","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Keep funding, selection and arrival decisions separate"}],[["$","p","Read the actual award package under the current degree guideline and later selection documents. Do not invent a personal stipend from another cohort or assume every household expense is covered. Record any language-study stage, award conditions, degree admission and arrival instructions under their own headings. An application receipt is not a scholarship result or immigration permission.",{"children":"Read the actual award package under the current degree guideline and later selection documents. Do not invent a personal stipend from another cohort or assume every household expense is covered. Record any language-study stage, award conditions, degree admission and arrival instructions under their own headings. An application receipt is not a scholarship result or immigration permission."}],["$","p","For a closed route, the useful next step may be to preserve submitted evidence or prepare a more precise academic plan for a newly announced cycle. Check official NIIED and country or university updates at the point you act. The present guide is an original route-comparison tool and a dated country example; it has not logged into an application account or verified an individual applicant’s eligibility.",{"children":"For a closed route, the useful next step may be to preserve submitted evidence or prepare a more precise academic plan for a newly announced cycle. Check official NIIED and country or university updates at the point you act. The present guide is an original route-comparison tool and a dated country example; it has not logged into an application account or verified an individual applicant’s eligibility."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
2b:["$","section","7-Continue with a specific application task",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Continue with a specific application task"}],[["$","p","Check the next decision with a focused programme, document or calculation guide.",{"children":"Check the next decision with a focused programme, document or calculation guide."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Continue with a specific application task","children":[["$","$L5","/scholarships/gist-graduate-scholarship/",{"href":"/scholarships/gist-graduate-scholarship/","children":["GIST graduate scholarship: funding components, fees and admission tasks",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
